    "title": "RaceTrac",
    "description": "Make some room, your pocket is now home to a simpler and more enjoyable version of the RaceTrac app. It was totally re-designed from the ground up for a better experience, and most importantly, to make your life that much app-ier. \r\nThis new app is loaded with benefits galore (and there\u2019s more on the way). Here\u2019s a glimpse into some of the fun new features. \r\n\r\n\u2022 Mobile Ordering*\r\n  Feed your pizza, snack, or drink craving with just one click.\r\n *Loyalty points and discounts are unavailable for mobile ordering at this time.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Points, Made Simple\r\n  It just takes one tap to earn, track, and redeem points. Easy peasy.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Personalized Fuel Pricing\r\n  We\u2019ll do the math to show any exclusive fuel discounts for you.\r\n  **Fuel prices listed in the app are subject to change and are not an offer.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Favorite Stores\r\n  Heart a store that\u2019s always on your mind to receive personalized offers.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Dark/Light Mode\r\n  Set the mood to whatever you\u2019re feeling and let your eyes do the rest.\r\n\r\n\u2022 24/7 Support\r\n  Questions? Chat with us wherever, whenever.\r\n\r\nAnd a special shoutout to RaceTrac Rewards members, because this version has your name written all over it. Kick back, relax, and watch the points rack up.",
